{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-linking-relations-table-table2-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:linking-relations-table-table2-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 2 from rem:linking-relations-table","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-linking-relations-table"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"linking-relations-table-table2-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:linking-relations-table-table2-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Data table 2 from rem:linking-relations-table</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Input</th>\n<th>Operation</th>\n<th>Output</th>\n<th>Physical meaning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,3}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^-</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u</code>)</td>\n<td>Global mirror <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,3}^{\\sigma}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^+</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d</code>)</td>\n<td>Particle <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\to</code> antiparticle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,5}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c</code>)</td>\n<td>Global mirror <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,5}^{\\sigma}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu^+</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s</code>)</td>\n<td>Muon/charm <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\to</code> antimuon/strange</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,7}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b^{\\sigma}</code>)</td>\n<td>Global mirror <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,7}^{\\sigma}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau^+</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code>)</td>\n<td>Tau/bottom <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\to</code> antitau/antibottom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{1,0}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nu</code>)</td>\n<td>Global mirror <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{1,0}^{\\sigma}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nu^{\\sigma}</code>)</td>\n<td>Neutrino <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\to</code> antineutrino</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code>)</td>\n<td>Global mirror <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code>)</td>\n<td>Self-mirror (amphichiral Higgs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{n}</code> = <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[u,d,d]_p</code></td>\n<td>Local <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code> at one <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{p}</code> = <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[u,u,d]_p</code></td>\n<td>Beta decay (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n \\to p</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,3} \\oplus T_{2,3}</code></td>\n<td>Skein at crossing</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{u}\\mathfrak{u}</code> Hopf <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\to</code> figure-eight (Higgs)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
